              "text": "گمشده (gomshode) — \"lost, missing\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "کیف گمشده من را در تاکسی پیدا کردند. Kif-e gomshode-ye man râ dar tâksi peydâ kardand. They found my lost bag in the taxi."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Ashyâ-ye gomshode — lost property."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "gomshode is built from native gom 'lost', which EtymDB lists, and shode, the past participle of shodan 'to become'."
            }
          ]
        },
