              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "پلیس راه (polis-e râh) ماشین ما را نگه داشت. Polis-e râh mâshin-e mâ râ negah dâsht. The highway police stopped our car."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Inside towns the traffic police is polis-e râhnamâyi va rânandegi."
            }
          ]
        },
